# Torre Vertice, 6F (a corporation 11F: Varo and the president, C6, contract 49), 16 x 12, interior. column = i, row = j. The arrival hall (rows 1..4) holds a last grunt; the wall of row 5 is shut by the fourth card-key
# door (4,5) (flag 846): below it DIRECTOR VARO waits (script `varo`, trainer varo_vtx: Quillord 37, Wombamma 35, Dunedrake 37, Quilltyrant 41; a win: flag 852, he leaves with his agents, the grunts of the city are gone);
# the PRESIDENT's office (10..15,1..4) is shut by the fifth card-key door (12,5) (flag 847): before Varo falls he asks for help, after it he gives the CRISTAL MAESTRO (Master Crystal, flag 853).
@map torre_vertice_6
@size 16 12
@interior yes
@area torre_vertice
@flag varo_vtx 852   # Director Varo was beaten in the tower
@flag maestro_given 853   # the president gave the Master Crystal (a full bag keeps it clear)
@flag kd4 846   # card-key door 4 (6F, Varo) opened
@flag kd5 847   # card-key door 5 (6F, the president's office) opened
@bg 0
@fill carpet_00
@spawn down 2 3 S
@legend
  .  tile=carpet_11
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  tile=carpet_01 object=escalator
  f  tile=carpet_01
  g  tile=carpet_10
  h  tile=carpet_00 door=escalator
  i  tile=carpet_00 object=desk
  j  tile=carpet_10 object=desk
  k  tile=carpet_00
  l  tile=carpet_00 object=planter
  m  tile=carpet_01 npc=vertice id=t6a face=W trainer=vertice_t6a range=4 text=tr.vertice_t6a.pre after=tr.vertice_t6a.after
  n  tile=carpet_11 npc=presidente id=pres face=SW script=president
  o  tile=carpet_10 object=planter
  p  tile=carpet_01 keydoor=chip_acceso hide_flag=kd4
  q  tile=carpet_01 keydoor=chip_acceso hide_flag=kd5
  r  tile=carpet_11 object=orb
  s  tile=carpet_01 object=orb
  t  tile=carpet_10 npc=varo id=varo face=NW script=varo hide_flag=varo_vtx gate=yes
  u  tile=carpet_11 object=desk
  v  tile=carpet_01 object=desk
  w  tile=carpet_00 item=disc_12
@grid
  abbbcbbbbcbbbcbb
  d.e.f.f.fdf.f.f.
  dghgijkgkdkglgkg
  d.f.f.m.fdf.fnf.
  dokgkgkgkdkgkgkg
  dbbbpbbbbbbbqbbb
  dgkgkgkgkgkgkgwg
  d.f.f.f.f.frf.s.
  dgkgkgktkgkgkgkg
  d.f.f.fuv.f.f.f.
  dokgkgkgkgkgkglg
  d.f.f.f.f.f.f.f.
@warp h -> torre_vertice_5 spawn=up
# Director Varo: the camera cuts to him; the fight (trainer varo_vtx); a win: his words, he walks away and is gone (flag 852: the grunts of Cenit leave, the president can
# be thanked), a loss is the blackout.
@script varo npc
    npc_face_hero varo
    cam_npc varo
    say vtx.varo.pre
    battle varo_vtx 0
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    say vtx.varo.win
    npc_walk varo SE 4
    npc_hide varo
    setf varo_vtx
    cam_hero
    say vtx.varo.gone
@end
# The president: before Varo falls he asks for help; after it he thanks the hero and gives the CRISTAL MAESTRO (a full bag keeps flag 853 clear and he hands
# it over at the next talk).
@script president npc
    npc_face_hero pres
    jf varo_vtx freed
    say vtx.pres.help
    end
  freed:
    jf maestro_given said
    say vtx.pres.thanks
    call maestro_gift
    end
  said:
    say vtx.pres.after
@end
@script maestro_gift called
    give_item cristal_maestro 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 cristal_maestro
    say gl.gift
    setf maestro_given
    say vtx.pres.give
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
@end
